      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030220,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 58,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "起初只是为了塑造角色，后来却渐渐变成了/n我对自己的提问。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302200490",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030220063,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030220,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 59,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "千寿历真让人不放心。/n居然差点把那种事当成真正的幸福。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302200500",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030220064,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030220,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 60,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "但结果来看，公演成功了。/n回应了期待的银河座，也进一步提高了评价。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302200510",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "301"
    },
