      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那王雪呢？/n在银河铁道上摇了一程，有得到什么吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302200540",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
